<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Listen</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>listen</a>
</pre>
<p>You perk up your ears and listen carefully to your surroundings. In many places 
there is something to hear that you wouldn't see: a river rushing nearby, a 
fire crackling, voices or footsteps somewhere close. Elsewhere you simply hear 
nothing special. Others in the room see you listening.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Look</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Search</a>
</pre>




</div>